<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Nov 7.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Nov 7.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Liverpool Nov 18.00 Jan/Mar 21.50</p>
<p>Southampton, Tewkesbury, Avonmouth and Gloucester Dec 117.00 Apr/Jun 121.00</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire Jan/Mar 18.00</p>
<p>Feedwheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Nov</p>
<p>97.50/98.00/98.50/99.00/99.25 Dec 99.00 Jan/Mar 99.50/100.00 April/June 102.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Nov 95.50/96.00 Dec 97.00/97.50</p>
<p>Avon range Dec 97.50/97.00 Jan/Mar 99.50 Apr/Jun 102.25</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire and Oxfordshire Jan 97.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Nov 97.00</p>
</text>
